---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Lukas Becker is a computer and software engineering student at Clarkson University focused on embedded systems, electronics, and software development."
		/>
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<title>Lukas Becker | Computer & Software Engineering</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header>
			<a class="name" href="#top">Lukas Becker</a>
			<nav aria-label="Main navigation">
				<a href="#top" aria-current="page">Home</a>
				<a href="#work"> Work</a>
				<a href="#about"> About</a>
				<a href="#contact"> Contact</a>
			</nav>
		</header>

		<main id="top">
			<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
				<p class="label">Computer engineering · Software engineering</p>
				<h1 id="page-title">Lukas Becker</h1>
				<p class="copy intro-copy">
					I am a Clarkson University Honors student building embedded systems,
					electronics projects, and practical software. I enjoy turning ideas into
					working hardware through programming, prototyping, and hands-on testing.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
				<div class="section-heading">
					<p class="label">01</p>
					<h2 id="work-title">Selected work</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="projects">
					<article>
						<p class="project-type">Embedded systems · C++</p>
						<h3>ESP32 RGBW Lighting Controller</h3>
						<p class="copy">
							Designed and programmed the controller for a 24-volt addressable RGBW
							lighting installation with 117 controllable segments around my room.
							Integrated a 38 kHz infrared receiver and 44-key remote for brightness,
							color, and animated effects while troubleshooting timing, signal, and
							library-compatibility issues.
						</p>
					</article>
					<article>
						<p class="project-type">Robotics · Controls</p>
						<h3>Meltybrain Combat Robot</h3>
						<p class="copy">
							Helped program, solder, and troubleshoot a combat robot capable of
							spinning at up to 2,000 RPM. The control system used accelerometer data
							to track speed and direction so the spinning robot could translate across
							the arena.
						</p>
					</article>
					<article>
						<p class="project-type">Electronics · Prototyping</p>
						<h3>Embedded Component Projects</h3>
						<p class="copy">
							Built smaller systems controlling stepper motors, LCD screens, speakers,
							and other components. These projects primarily use I2C, with additional
							experience using SPI and UART communication.
						</p>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section id="about" class="split" aria-labelledby="about-title">
				<div class="section-heading">
					<p class="label">02</p>
					<h2 id="about-title">About</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="copy about-copy">
					<p>
						I am pursuing dual B.S. degrees in Computer Engineering and Software
						Engineering at Clarkson University, with an expected graduation date of
						May 2028. I have a 3.968 GPA, participate in the Honors Program, and have
						been a Presidential Scholar every semester.
					</p>
					<p>
						My experience includes C++, MATLAB, Simulink, Linux, embedded communication
						protocols, circuit debugging, soldering, oscilloscopes, digital multimeters,
						SolidWorks, and Onshape. Outside the classroom, I am a dedicated Pep Band member and
						Pre-Orientation Leader, and I have completed more than 24 hours of Honors
						Program service at the North Country Children's Museum.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section id="contact" class="split" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
				<div class="section-heading">
					<p class="label">03</p>
					<h2 id="contact-title">Contact</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="copy contact-copy">
					<p>
						I am interested in internship opportunities involving embedded systems,
						computer engineering, software development, or robotics.
					</p>
					<div class="contact-links">
						<a class="contact-link" href="mailto:LukasTBecker@gmail.com">
							LukasTBecker@gmail.com
						</a>
						<a class="contact-link" href="https://github.com/beckerlt2028" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
							GitHub · beckerlt2028 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer>
			<p>© {year} Lukas Becker</p>
			<a href="#top">Back to top</a>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
	:root {
		font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
		color: #181818;
		background: #fff;
		scroll-behavior: smooth;
	}

	* { box-sizing: border-box; }

	body {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
	a:hover { color: #4f46e5; }

	header,
	main,
	footer {
		width: min(100% - 48px, 1080px);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	header {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		height: 80px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
	}

	.name { font-weight: 650; }
	nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
	nav a { color: #555; font-size: 14px; }
	nav a[aria-current="page"] { color: #181818; }

	main > section {
		padding: 96px 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
		scroll-margin-top: 32px;
	}

	.intro {
		min-height: 520px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.label {
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		color: #777;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: .08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0 0 28px;
		font-size: clamp(52px, 9vw, 96px);
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: -.055em;
		font-weight: 650;
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
		line-height: 1.1;
		letter-spacing: -.035em;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	h3 {
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		font-size: 20px;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.copy {
		max-width: 620px;
		margin: 0;
		color: #555;
	}

	.intro-copy {
		font-size: 19px;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.section-heading { margin-bottom: 48px; }
	.section-heading .label { margin-bottom: 12px; }

	.projects {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 24px;
	}

	.projects article {
		min-height: 220px;
		padding: 28px;
		border: 1px solid #dedede;
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.project-type {
		margin: 0 0 10px;
		color: #777;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 650;
		letter-spacing: .06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.split {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 40px;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.split .section-heading { margin: 0; }
	.split > .copy { padding-top: 36px; }
	.about-copy p,
	.contact-copy p { margin: 0 0 18px; }

	.contact-link {
		display: inline-block;
		color: #181818;
		font-weight: 650;
		border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
	}

	.contact-links {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	footer {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding-block: 32px;
		color: #777;
		font-size: 13px;
	}

	footer p { margin: 0; }

	@media (max-width: 680px) {
		header, main, footer { width: min(100% - 32px, 1080px); }
		header { align-items: flex-start; height: auto; padding-block: 20px; gap: 20px; }
		nav { flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px 14px; }
		main > section { padding: 72px 0; }
		.intro { min-height: 430px; }
		.projects, .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.split { gap: 28px; }
		.split > .copy { padding-top: 0; }
	}
</style>
